      "hints": [
        "Complete the square on $16x^2 - 24x + 10$ by writing $(4x + a)^2$.",
        "Expand $(4x + a)^2 = 16x^2 + 8ax + a^2$ and match coefficients."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Match $16x^2 - 24x + 10$ with $(4x + a)^2 + b = 16x^2 + 8ax + a^2 + b$:\n$$8a = -24 \\implies a = -3$$",
        "Determine the constant term $b$:\n$$a^2 + b = 10 \\implies (-3)^2 + b = 10 \\implies 9 + b = 10 \\implies b = 1$$",
        "State the completed square form:\n$$16x^2 - 24x + 10 = (4x - 3)^2 + 1$$"
      ],
      "checking": {
        "mode": "ai",
        "ai_rubric": {
          "Completed Square Form": "Finds $a = -3$ (B1) and $b = 1$ (B1) giving $(4x - 3)^2 + 1$."
        },
        "criteria_source": "mark_scheme_structured"
      }
